@AuroraProxy_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

GET {{AuroraProxy_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{AuroraProxy_HostAddress}}/api/revit-query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Connection test from Revit"
}

### Streaming response

POST {{AuroraProxy_HostAddress}}/api/revit-query/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "prompt": "Explain how to select all walls"
}
